# annotation-of on non-function values returns empty dict (the fallback branch in
# builtin_annotation_of). Value::Annotated is never constructed until T-1121 (unit
# constructor wrapping) or T-1119 (dict-key annotation syntax). Until then this test
# exercises the else branch: non-function, non-Annotated values → empty dict.
#
# annotation-of 42 → Dict({}) since Int has no annotation.
[result: [annotation-of 42]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Dict({})})
